<title>Myanmar's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/myanmar/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-myanmar-2026-11-23T15:05:04.863Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 15:05:04 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The International Court of Justice ruled that Myanmar committed genocide against the Rohingya, prompting Malaysia to pledge cooperation with the UN, OIC and ASEAN, while the junta accused ASEAN of unfairness in its peace-plan review. In May 2026 a Burma Army air strike in Doo Tha Htoo District killed one villager and injured five, including two children, and destroyed houses in Bilin Township. The junta continues large-scale attacks on Rohingya civilians, including a bridge-destruction campaign in Arakan and the advance of a 108‑kilometre fence on the Bangladesh border. It also admitted corruption in its conscription system and began actions against nearly two hundred officials. There were 2,332 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168836&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/21/rohingya-who-escaped-myanmars-genocide-tell-their-stories&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigwFBVV95cUxPVl94VHFXRmxvdjNydktsSEhia2todlU5enZjY0tnaGNwVFp6ZE9DRGtXSTc1YjZFbXFWOFc2OXFTU3QzdFA1RnA5ZEJoaDJpc2xneFN5UUV0d3lPWFBTeFIyYTV6c09MWGFiNDhrdFNpN2d0Qkt5VmVqTnpDbGN2emxiNA?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.scmp.com/news/china/diplomacy/article/3375454/how-will-chinas-ties-myanmar-change-icjs-genocide-ruling&quot;&gt;South China Morning Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiywFBVV95cUxPc1o1UExKZjh5bWFmd1U0dHczS3RVdl9WNGRlakFPX2I2aEhNN3cxXzB0bDJpR21QNVdnNWMtdDB1RjQ2T2hQVTRvU1N0YzlZZEZIQXA2MDdUdGI5cTUxVlBiYjNyYjdQYk9nMWJtV1ppQmRfVHJpcVE5aVJTc